            <div>
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-blue-100 text-[#0969da]">
                Target Anggaran &amp; Tahapan Pembangunan Masjid
              </span>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 mb-0">
                Atur target kebutuhan dana dan tahapan pengerjaan masjid di lapangan.
              </p>
            </div>
            <button
              type="button"
              id="btnAddMasjidMilestone"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-[#0969da] text-white hover:bg-[#0752a8] transition-colors cursor-pointer self-start sm:self-auto shrink-0"
            >
              <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line></svg>
              <span>Tambah Tahapan</span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 space-y-3">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <div>
                <label for="vfMasjidTargetAmount" class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1">Target Nominal Anggaran (Angka Rupiah)</label>
                <input type="number" id="vfMasjidTargetAmount" min="0" placeholder="1310753350" class="w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-xs text-slate-900 focus:bg-white focus:border-[#0969da] outline-none" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="vfMasjidTarget" class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1">Teks Target Dana</label>
                <input type="text" id="vfMasjidTarget" placeholder="Rp 1.310.753.350" class="w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-xs text-slate-900 focus:bg-white focus:border-[#0969da] outline-none" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mb-0">
              Jumlah dana terhimpun dan persentase capaian dihitung otomatis dari donasi lunas yang masuk.
            </p>
